    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d774">

                <pb facs="0746" n="736" xml:id="pg736"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.24/1190: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lauchlin Currie,
                        Administrative Assistant to President Roosevelt, to
                        Madame Chiang Kai-shek
                    </hi><anchor n="10" xml:id="d774-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-10-16">October 16, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Shipping 285 anti-aircraft 50-caliber guns. No more available at present owing to
                    necessity of arming all our merchant ships. Hope for more later. Authority has
                    been granted for you to hire 200 more pilots here.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
